     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Yen-Ting,<div><br></div><div>看你的畫面應該是Windows, 建議下載&quot;SOMbrero_1.2.zip&quot; 測試, 另安裝R的套件時, 須安裝其他相依套件, 因此只有一個&quot;SOMbrero_1.2.zip&quot; 是不夠安裝. 該套件須要其他套件, 例: knitr, igraph, ....</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/SOMbrero/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/SOMbrero/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZaB1yrZwuVlUAOmiCnZz_\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/SOMbrero/index.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><table summary=\"Package SOMbrero summary\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\">Version:</td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\">1.2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\">Depends:</td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\">R (≥ 3.1.0), <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/knitr/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/knitr/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WHTyZmIp7ucb3TF9IP4Xn\">knitr</a>, <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/igraph/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/igraph/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YgnAf8y8CALK98-gZnU8O\">igraph</a> (≥ 1.0)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top\">Imports:</td><td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/wordcloud/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/wordcloud/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GDDiLmS_RVAEZfSPQposF\">wordcloud</a>, <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/scatterplot3d/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/scatterplot3d/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qneVRWBpFWdk_-RIDgvB3\">scatterplot3d</a>, <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RColorBrewer/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RColorBrewer/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Awyg3kVZ8TmXqOsqjmtSH\">RColorBrewer</a>, <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/shiny/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:blue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/shiny/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237756384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BbSMiueEHaM5b3lDgDB--\">shiny</a>, grDevices, graphics, stats</td></tr></tbody></table><br></div><div>可考慮將其他已安裝 SOMbrero 套件A電腦 R\\library 目錄的所有資料夾內容複製(不要取代30個基本套件)到沒有網路環境B電腦的R\\library 資料夾, 此時B電腦即可使用 SOMbrero 套件.</div><div># end</div><div><br>Yen-ting於 2017年3月21日星期二 UTC+8下午7時52分00秒寫道：</div></div>"
